# Deterministic EOLs (the Windows smudge lesson, WS-ERP E6): the source tree
# is LF; `core.autocrlf=true` hosts must not smudge it — otherwise git-apply
# round-trips (the sabotage harness's byte-exact restore) churn CRLF residue
# into the worktree and templates-parity goldens drift CR-only.
*.ex   text eol=lf
*.exs  text eol=lf
*.eex  text eol=lf
*.patch text eol=lf
# The templates-parity golden fixtures (the renderer emits LF; the fixtures
# must hold it byte-exactly).
*.golden text eol=lf
